"\n\n\n\n\n## Review\nI didn't have high expectations.  \nA movie that overcame an experimental exorcism theme and lack of fun elements in Korea through casting.  \n\nThere seem to be hidden details, such as taxi numbers or contrasting light and darkness, but I didn't delve deep into it as it's a world I don't know well.  \n\nThe genre of this movie is Kang Dong-won."